          "policy": "Equal graded enrollments, NULL excluded, all offerings/retakes. Absent filters mean all including semesters. Mean projections COALESCE(SUM(e.grade_units),0) AS sum_units, COUNT(e.grade_units) AS graded_count, COUNT(*) AS enrollment_count. Base Enrollments e JOIN Offerings o ON e.offering_id=o.offering_id. Optional equality predicates named student_id/course_id/teacher_id/semester_id; group keys e.student_id or o.course_id/teacher_id/offering_id/semester_id. For rows GROUP BY key ORDER BY key. Top returns ALL course components, adapter selects exact maximum ties. student_ids uses SELECT DISTINCT e.student_id ORDER BY e.student_id. Dependency course_ids/student_ids bind named <ref>_0,<ref>_1 etc in IN clause. Empty ref WHERE 0=1. Listing adds Students s,Courses c,Teachers t joins on IDs and ordered declared projections; ORDER BY e.offering_id,e.student_id."
